<article class="env-lemma" id="0321">
       
      
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0321">Lemma <span data-tag="0321">10.158.8</span>.</a> Let $k$ be a field. </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
If the characteristic of $k$ is zero, then any extension field of $k$ is formally smooth over $k$. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
If the characteristic of $k$ is $p > 0$, then $K/k$ is formally smooth if and only if it is a separable field extension. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Combine Lemmas <a href="/tag/031Y" data-tag="031Y">10.158.5</a> and <a href="/tag/0320" data-tag="0320">10.158.7</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>